{"unit_id":"yangyongzhen__dsh-article-publish#card-zh","repo":"yangyongzhen/dsh-article-publish","commit":"12f43523d8d13ec82aca117b3179d9ff1f1e0fe1","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-article-publish 是一个 DSH 工具插件，可在会话中调用文章发布和资讯获取工具。它向 DSH 的 tools 服务注册 publish_article 与 fetch_news：前者接收平台、标题和 Markdown 正文，可发布到 CSDN、掘金或博客园，并返回文章链接；还支持 CSDN 文章更新、摘要生成和外链图片处理。后者从博客园科技资讯 RSS 随机取得一条标题和摘要，作为写作素材。适合希望在 DSH 写作流程中直接发布技术文章或获取资讯素材的用户。发布需要目标平台登录 Cookie，博客园还需要 XSRF token；凭据可通过插件配置或环境变量提供。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:49","lib/index.js:98","src/index.ts:53","src/news.ts:11"]}
{"unit_id":"yangyongzhen__dsh-article-publish#card-en","repo":"yangyongzhen/dsh-article-publish","commit":"12f43523d8d13ec82aca117b3179d9ff1f1e0fe1","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-article-publish adds two DSH tools: publish Markdown articles to CSDN, Juejin, or CNBlogs, and fetch random tech news from the CNBlogs RSS feed. Publishing returns a link and supports CSDN updates and image handling. Platform cookies are required; CNBlogs also needs an XSRF token.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:49","lib/index.js:98","src/index.ts:53","src/news.ts:11"]}
